# Architecture overview

**Church of Beef** — social guild ladder for **TBC Classic Anniversary** (`## Interface: 20506`). Plain global `ChurchOfBeef` / `COB` — no AceAddon in V1. Not raid/combat tooling.

## Non-negotiables

- Announce / track / sync only — no bots, injection, protected-action bypass, or gameplay automation
- No Retail / Dragonflight-only APIs
- Layers: UI→Core→Data and Net→Core→Data only; never Core→UI
- UI never awards points; Net never invents ranks; Core never `CreateFrame`; Data never reads SV

## Repo map

```
.worktrees/feat-church-of-beef-v1/   # addon checkout when absent on main
  addon/ChurchOfBeef/                # → Interface/AddOns/ChurchOfBeef/
    Data/                            # Machine canon (Ranks.lua)
    Core/                            # Ladder, scoring, officer gate
    Net/                             # BeefNet + Sync
    UI/                              # Frames, tabs, toasts, minimap
    ChurchOfBeef.toc                 # Load order = dependency graph
    ChurchOfBeef.lua                 # Bootstrap: events, /beef, Init
  tests/                             # Desktop Lua Core harness
docs/superpowers/                    # Spec + plan (product law)
docs/canon/                          # Lore prose only (no numbers)
docs/phases/                         # Roadmap / V1 checklist
```

Keep the Cursor workspace on **Beef_Addon** (this repo) so `.cursor/rules` apply. Edit worktree Lua from the parent workspace — see `AGENTS.md`.

## Authority

| Truth | Location |
|-------|----------|
| Rank ids, titles, thresholds, seats, officer index | `addon/ChurchOfBeef/Data/Ranks.lua` only |
| Product decisions | `docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-25-church-of-beef-design.md` |
| Task / file layout | `docs/superpowers/plans/2026-07-25-church-of-beef-v1.md` |
| Lore prose | `docs/canon/` — never duplicate numeric thresholds |

## Entry points

`Data → Core → Net + UI → ChurchOfBeef.lua` (bootstrap last).

| Phase | Runs |
|-------|------|
| `ADDON_LOADED` (`ChurchOfBeef`) | `COB.DB:Init()` |
| `PLAYER_LOGIN` | `COB.UI:Init()`, `COB.Net:Init()`, `COB.Sync:OnLogin()` |
| `/beef` | `COB.UI:Toggle()` |

SV = per-character `ChurchOfBeefDB`. BeefNet prefix `COB` / channel `GUILD`.

## Edit preferences

- Extend planned modules (`Core/Ladder.lua`, `Net/BeefNet.lua`, …) over new top-level files
- Expand TOC only when the file exists; never list missing files
- Keep `ChurchOfBeef*.lua` casing consistent (case-sensitive packaging)
- Prefer `docs/superpowers/` + `Data/Ranks.lua` over inventing policy from `docs/research/`
- Major UI polish / juice follows the UI brief + skill § Polish loop + glob `ui-juice-standards.mdc` (`docs/superpowers/ui-polished-direction-for-agents.md`, `.cursor/skills/church-of-beef-dev/SKILL.md`) — not a new always-on rule factory ([34] four-rule pack stays deferred)
